# Exception: .swiftpm/xcode/xcshareddata/xcschemes/StoreTests.xcscheme is force-tracked
# (git add -f) — it's the only way to run the StoreTests package target via
# `xcodebuild test -scheme StoreTests`, since XcodeGen can't wire an SPM test
# target into ShopApp.xcodeproj's native scheme. Nested negation patterns don't
# work here: git won't descend into a wholesale-excluded directory to check for
# re-include rules on paths inside it.

